# API Changelog 1.0.0 vs. 1.0.0


## API Changes

### POST /test
- :warning: removed the enum value `serviceAccount` of the request property `optionalEnum`
- :warning: removed the enum value `user` of the request property `optionalEnum`
-  request property `optionalEnum` list-of-types was widened by adding types `null` to media type `application/json`




## Info
